# 30 fps variable jump against the PS2 (platform/3ds/tests/pad_ring_test.c has the model).
# One jump in place per press length; "mid" = the change lands on the frame's middle 60 Hz sample.
# Expect the apex to rise ~0.41 m per level (2.49 m / 6), then camera turns.
